            "settings-save-bar-save: Save settings",
          ],
          "text": "Environments v2Connect this instance to another environment so your workflows can be promoted.Promote instancePush all projects on this instance to your connected Git remote.PromoteConnect the promote branch in the instance connection below before you promote.Git providersA provider holds the credentials for a Git host. Connections share the provider.GitHub botUsername and passwordConfigureDeploy keySSH keyConfigureAdd providerStore the credentials for a Git host.Instance connectionThe repository this instance promotes to and applies from.Provider *Add providerName *Remote URL *SSH key providers take ssh://… or [user@]host:path. Username and password providers take an https:// URL.ApplyBring changes from Git into this instance.Apply branch *Connected to mainDisconnectPromoteSend changes from this instance to Git.Promote base branch *Create a branch on promoteEach promote starts a new branch from the base branch, for review before it merges.Save your changes before you connect.ConnectUnsaved changesDiscard changesSave settings",
        },
        "route": "/settings/promotions",
      },
